   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Alladin**: back after 37 archived shows (1280 days) [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Manic Depression, Eleanor Rigby, I Want You (She's So Heavy) [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2009-10-23.akg481.r44.goldstein.burke.flac24** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 113 min [1]\n- **soulive2009-10-23.akg481.r44.goldstein.burke.flac16**: source not stated; 12 songs; 113 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2009-10-23.akg481.r44.goldstein.burke.flac24**: taped by Brian Goldstein; transferred by Brian Goldstein; source: 24 bit: AKG CK61|C480B > Darktrain silver XLR interconnects > Edirol R-44 [1]. Also: Recorded with AKG CK61 capsules and C480B preamp through Darktrain XLR cables into an Edirol R-44, at 24-bit/48 kHz; Files went from SDHC card to PC, were edited in WaveLab 5.01b with a gain boost, then saved as 24-bit FLAC [1]\n- **soulive2009-10-23.akg481.r44.goldstein.burke.flac16**: taped by Brian Goldstein; transferred by Brian Goldstein; source: 16 bit: AKG CK61|C480B > Darktrain silver XLR interconnects > Edirol R-44 [2]",
